;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\公園野次馬.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "2000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"What a crowd..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was called a park, but it wasn't a grand one like you'd see in a big city, just a children's park about 100 meters on each side.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\フェンス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The playground equipment was clustered in the middle, with cherry trees lined up all around it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The outside was enclosed by a fence about 1.2 meters high, so you could see into the park from anywhere.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally, the park was off-limits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Quite a few police officers were still at work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The blue tarp I'd seen in the photos online had been removed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Around it was a group that looked like the press, and farther out still, dozens of rubberneckers had gathered.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mixed in among them, there had to be some of the denizens of that message board.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Geez, every last one of them... Don't these guys have anything better to do...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was hardly something </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> was in a position to say.</STYLE><PG>
"With this, the food stalls'll probably be shut down for a while. Good thing I went yesterday..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="こごおり">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE>-senpaaai<STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "300" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">No sooner had a girl's shout rung out than someone slammed into us from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was only one girl who called us Senpai and greeted us like this.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So you were both here!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? It's <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE>. So <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> came too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes! Did you both just get here, Senpai?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned from ear to ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I was way too bored, so I dragged <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> along."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Incidentally, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="こごおり">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is my family name, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And this noisy little shrimp is my junior, one year below me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">She was the one </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> had mentioned in passing yesterday, the very culprit who'd eaten her way through the park's food stalls.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Though she's as small as a child, she has a bottomless stomach.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm, but are you okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? The cherry blossoms don't bother you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'm feeling weirdly good today."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that so! Then that is splendid news indeed! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hey, hey, Senpai, do you two have a minute? Actually, you do, right? You came here because you were bored."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s words made </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s eyes sparkle.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh! You got some good info or something?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Just what I'd expect of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">! Your nose for this sort of thing is something fierce! Truth is, </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">, it's exactly as you say, gesu!"</STYLE> [TN: "gesu" = a stock servile underling verb ending from period dramas]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> rubbed her hands together and sidled up to </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Who're you supposed to be...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I've been here since this morning gathering all kinds of information. I'd wager I'm the civilian best informed on this incident, you know!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE>! Have you had lunch?! This <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE>-senpai's treating you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oooh! Just what I'd expect of the </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Operation successful!"</STYLE><PG>
"Hah! So you were after lunch all along. Well, I've got a war chest today anyway."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> hit it off when it comes to things like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I met first, but ever since I introduced her to </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> later on, it's always like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's a fine thing that they get along, but getting dragged around by it is exhausting.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Come on, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>! Let's go! We're moving to Zahha!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, wait up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Before I knew it, the two of them were already on their bikes.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the end, we were only at the park for 2 or 3 minutes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But thanks to running into </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it looked like we'd learn quite a lot.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We arrived at Zahha.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We come to this family restaurant every so often.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A lot of what looked like school bikes were parked outside.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Welcome. A party of three?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Zahha was very crowded today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the look of it, it was nothing but groups of high schoolers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">High schoolers overflowing from the park and the family restaurant both. So much for the stay-at-home order.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Now, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, don't hold back! Eat whatever you want!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Boss, you sure are generous today, same as always."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gleefully opened the menu.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Once we'd finished ordering, we each came back from the drink bar.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, just watch out for one thing."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yep?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"If it was just me, I wouldn't mind, but today <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>'s here too. Anything that'll ruin <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>'s food for her, save it for after we eat."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"As you command, </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">! Understood!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> snapped off a salute.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well then, on to carrying out the Operation! Where should I start..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a notepad out of her pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, with a suddenly serious face, she began staring at the notepad.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ummm... you already know a body was found, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　The body was found at around 5:10 a.m. It was discovered by a 68-year-old man. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Apparently he'd gone into the park to set up his food stall."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"At that point, the victim was apparently still alive. Calling for help in a moaning sort of voice, it seems. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The man was startled, but he called the police and an ambulance right away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Didn't make it, huh..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. But that much is in the news already, so it's not particularly good info."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
