<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPD TIME="4294967256">"Uhmm, fo, bevowe, a fimihar infihenh, a fimihar infihenh haffened, affawenhwyUhmm, fo, bevowe, a fimihar infihenh, a fimihar infihenh haffened, affawenhwyUhmm, fo, bevowe, a fimihar infihenh, a fimihar infihenh haffened, affawenhwy</STYLE>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
<TXSPN>"Swallow the meat before you talk..."
