<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> said so, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned from ear to ear and </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\ごくり.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">swallowed with a gulp.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mmm!</STYLE>
