<STYLE ID="8">a</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sip of her miso soup.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah... Okay, um. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Apparently it happened before, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">A similar incident."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
