"A similar incident, like today's?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. Well, I'll give you the details after we eat, though. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">The Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> murders, do you know about them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... murders?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. In neighboring </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, there's </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There, every few years, and on April 8 no less, brutalized bodies are found."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd heard of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it was more than just having heard of it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, for about 10 years now, every 3 years or so, there have been murders in the next prefecture over, in </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture</STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="めがさわし">'s Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・They occur every few years, always on April 8</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The bodies are found in an abnormally gruesome state</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Two people are killed each time</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Crimes physically impossible for a human</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・They have happened three times so far</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What's more, the culprit reportedly still hasn't been caught.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't remember the details, but every incident was supposed to have had a method so uncanny it could only be thought of as a spiriting-away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Things that would call for instantaneous movement or a leap of several meters, or else monstrous strength no human could produce.</STYLE><PG>
"Th-that sounds familiar somehow..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s expression stiffened, and she answered in a low voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Actually, I thought this incident and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> murders might be connected, so I was looking into it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But then I made another new discovery."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a sip of cola and caught her breath.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The first Megasawa City case happened 10 years ago, on April 8, Shiyo 790. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But on April 8, several years before that, </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">right here in Motoki-cho, in Central Park, one hanami visitor died, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? At the Central Park we were just at?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, that Central Park. In other words, counting today's incident, people have died on April 8 five times."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">I got goosebumps.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In Motoki-cho, where even an incident was rare, in the park, in hanami season, someone had died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So, twice in Motoki-cho, three times in Megasawa City, there were murders on April 8..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that's not quite right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The first one, at Motoki-cho's Central Park, was purely an accidental death. There were plenty of witnesses as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">An off-duty police officer was apparently at the hanami too, so the chance it was an incident is zero. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nom nom..."</STYLE><PG>
