{PAUSE ""}
　Our moms were childhood friends, and that's how we've been friends too, ever since we were old enough to remember. 
{PAUSE ""}
After I moved, it was letters and email. 
{PAUSE ""}
When it was decided 3 years ago that we'd come back to Motoki-cho, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> told me, 'The place next door is empty.' 
{PAUSE ""}
I begged <STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE>, and we moved into the place we're in now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> spoke in a soft voice, as if reminiscing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I see!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Oh, did you know? Motoki-cho is famous for its cherry blossoms, and its population is growing fast!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Seems lots of people are moving here for the cherry blossoms. The population's already over 40,000, so it's only a matter of time before it becomes Motoki 'City.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh! I knew Motoki-cho was famous for cherry blossoms, but so that's why the population's grown so much!
{PAUSE ""}
　Come to think of it, all kinds of buildings are going up all over the place!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>And the goshinboku at Central Park especially, that's really something."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It sure is! Oh! Speaking of cherry blossoms―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh... <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>... let's drop the cherry blossom talk about now..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh... I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
