<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, right, they probably thought it wasn't good to talk about cherry blossoms too much in front of me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ahaha, just talking about them doesn't bother me. It's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making the people around me tiptoe like this is apparently one of the traits of April sickness, too. [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4">, I was really happy when you came back! But still, not having your dad around must be lonely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> has only been on a business trip to Hokkaido since yesterday, and even that's lonely..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Honestly, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE> really are a daddy's girl..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? But if they're family, of course you want them close by, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having said that much, I happened to glance over at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and―</STYLE><PG>
