<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahem. Well then..."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"This time of year, by 5 in the morning, a fair number of people come to the park. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Since it's gotten warmer, elderly people for walks, students for morning practice. And of course setting up the food stalls."</STYLE><PG>
"So being found at 5 in the morning isn't that unnatural, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right. The problem is that between the discovery and the police arriving, the body―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">to be precise, the victim on the verge of becoming a body, was seen by a lot of people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But..."</STYLE><PG>
"But...?"<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I gulped, and so did </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No one could make out the face, or the sex, or the age. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
