{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But that was in the online news too. That they couldn't tell the sex and stuff."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's the police's point of view. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What matters is that 'the witnesses are ordinary people.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's that supposed to mean?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Listen, okay? The police are strictly a public body. They don't put out opinions with anything subjective in them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">They don't make public anything but objective information."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh-huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Somehow </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s talk was getting complicated.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But what about ordinary people? Don't they talk about things only subjectively? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">'Probably a man,' 'probably someone young,' I think they'd say at least that much."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, true..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But if there's none of that, it means the damage to the body was so severe you couldn't even tell the sex, doesn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And yet! When found, the victim was still alive!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">I think there's only one condition a body could be in for that to happen."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Not a trace remained of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who'd been grinning from ear to ear just a moment ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We were hanging on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s every word.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">And then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a sip of water and said this.</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "0"}
{}
